  "body": "## DeepSeek Harness 0.1.0-rc.5\n\nAutomated build of the DeepSeek Harness repository.\n\n### Windows portable package\n- `dsh-windows-x64-0.1.0-rc.5.zip` — unzip, then run `dsh.cmd` (requires Node.js >= 22.19).\n\n### npm packages archive\nAll `@deepseek-ai/*` packages as npm tarballs, bundled into one archive:\n```\ndsh-npm-packages-0.1.0-rc.5.zip\n```\nUnzip it, then install any package globally with `npm i -g <file>.tgz`, or add\nthe tarball of `@deepseek-ai/dsh` to your project dependencies.\n\n### Verify\nSHA256SUMS lists every artifact's checksum.\n"
